That's amazing!

268
00:45:45,454 --> 00:45:45,684
会場内のね、これあのなんと、
And inside the venue,

269
00:45:48,474 --> 00:45:48,484
ね、
you know,

270
00:45:49,484 --> 00:45:49,954
